  "slug": "rusfurence",
  "name": "Rusfurence",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Rusfurence (Русфуренция), known as Rusfurrence before 2015 and also as RusCon or the Russian Furry Conference, was the largest furry convention in Russia, held in the Moscow area from 1999 to 2019. It began as Ukiwa's birthday party on February 26, 1999, with six attendees, and was usually held in late January or early February as student holidays began. It moved from a cultural center to boarding houses and hotels outside Moscow, including the Zvenigorodskiy boarding house and the Hotel Heliopark Thalasso, and attendance grew to over 400. The 2019 edition moved to late August.",
